# NOTE: .colosseum/ is INTENTIONALLY tracked here.
# It contains the methodology validation artifacts (intent.md, ledger.md,
# change records, adversarial reports) that are the deliverable of this repo.
# This is the opposite of colosseum's own .gitignore policy — there, .colosseum/
# is per-project state; here, .colosseum/ IS the project.
